{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/23499-changeling-and-the-god-machine-updates","id":23499,"title":"Changeling and the God Machine updates","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-04T21:26:35-08:00","id":23499,"title":"Changeling and the God Machine updates","content":"How do these updates impact changelings? We are in a crossover style game with 2 vampires and a changeling. Obviously the vampires will be covered by B &amp; S...but worried that we won't be able to convert due to changeling rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1527-chavyvampire","name":"ChavyVampire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T00:02:27-08:00","id":23580,"title":"","content":"The stated intent of the Onyx Path folks is to try to get a GMC update for all the games in time. In the mean time the best you can do is try to hack together a conversion yourself. You can use the GMC update and B&amp;S to get a good idea of how to convert XP costs. The CtL specific Merits shouldn't need any major revision because of the update. The biggest hurdles are going to be:<br /> <br /> Deciding how you want to handle Clarity, though Clarity is probably better done by modifying Integrity than the B&amp;S approach to Humanity. You just need to adjust the breaking points a bit to account for changelings not being as phased by the supernatural (though things from Arcadia should still be breaking points).<br /> <br /> Figuring out any places where the new combat rules will require something gets reworked.<br /> <br /> Figuring out any places where powers should create Conditions (but B&amp;S and Demon should be good guides for this).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}